    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:00Z",
      "text": "The Judicial Committee of the Privy Council overturns colonial-era provisions criminalizing consensual same-sex sexual activity between adults in Trinidad and Tobago…",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-10:13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "Although same-sex sexual activity has been legalised as of November 10, 2026, households headed by same-sex couples are not eligible for the same rights and benefits as that of opposite-sex couples.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385553591:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:16Z",
      "text": "Lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender and queer (LGBTQ) people in Trinidad and Tobago face legal challenges not experienced by non-LGBTQ residents.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1385553591:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "The map shows the Judicial Committee of the Privy Council in the United Kingdom, where the reports place it.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-10:13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:33Z",
      "text": "The story was reported by CNN and Reuters.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-10:13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-10T00:00:41Z",
